{"id":32355,"slug":"devil-in-a-blue-dress","title":"Devil in a Blue Dress","year":1995,"country":"United States","duration":101,"spine":1135,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/32355-devil-in-a-blue-dress","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/441f15951d11737dd6ecd2e90164eb65/FnKPiHfC7guNUdSNI2R8K2z5yFt3Os_large.jpg","description":"The bone-deep disillusionment of postwar film noir becomes a powerful vehicle to explore America’s racial injustices in Carl Franklin’s richly atmospheric Devil in a Blue Dress, an adaptation of the hard-boiled novel by Walter Mosley. Denzel Washington has charisma to burn as the jobless ex-GI Easy Rawlins, who sees a chance to make some quick cash when he’s recruited to find the missing lover (Jennifer Beals) of a wealthy mayoral candidate in late-1940s Los Angeles—only to find himself embroiled in murder, political intrigue, and a scandal that crosses the treacherous color lines of a segregated society. Featuring breakout work by Don Cheadle as Rawlins’s cheerfully trigger-happy sidekick, this stylish mystery both channels and subverts classic noir tropes as it exposes the bitter racial realities underlying the American dream.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Carl Franklin","slug":"carl-franklin"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Denzel Washington","role":"Easy Rawlins","slug":"denzel-washington"},{"actor":"Tom Sizemore","role":"Dewitt Albright","slug":"tom-sizemore"},{"actor":"Jennifer Beals","role":"Daphne Monet","slug":"jennifer-beals"},{"actor":"Don Cheadle","role":"Mouse","slug":"don-cheadle"},{"actor":"Maury Chaykin","role":"Matthew Terell","slug":"maury-chaykin"},{"actor":"Terry Kinney","role":"Todd Carter","slug":"terry-kinney"},{"actor":"Mel Winkler","role":"Joppy","slug":"mel-winkler"},{"actor":"Albert Hall","role":"Odell","slug":"albert-hall"},{"actor":"Lisa Nicole Carson","role":"Coretta James","slug":"lisa-nicole-carson"},{"actor":"Jernard Burks","role":"Dupree Bouchard","slug":"jernard-burks"}],"cr